  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "World Heroes 2 by features 12 different characters, all of which are from different franchises. Fighters include Leonardo from TMNT, Haggar from Final Fight, Sonic, Mario, Ryu from Street Fighter and Son Goku from Dragon Ball Z."
    },
    {
      "langue": "fr",
      "text": "Jeu de baston pirate qui oppose des personnages de Street Fighter 2, Final Fight, de Dragon Ball Z, des Tortues Ninja et même de Super Mario Bros et Sonice The Hedgehog."
    },
    {
      "langue": "de",
      "text": "Jogo de luta pirata com personagens de Street Fighter 2, Final Fight, Dragon Ball Z, Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles e até Super Mario Bros e Sonice The Hedgehog"
    },
    {
      "langue": "es",
      "text": "World Heroes por diferentes tipos de franquicias. Los luchadores incluyen a Leonardo de TMNT, Haggar de Final Fight, Sonic, Mario, Ryu de Street Fighter y Son Goku de Dragon Ball Z."
    },
    {
      "langue": "it",
      "text": "World Heroes 2 di presenta 12 personaggi diversi, tutti provenienti da franchise diversi. I combattenti includono Leonardo di TMNT, Haggar di Final Fight, Sonic, Mario, Ryu di Street Fighter e Son Goku di Dragon Ball Z."
    }
